    tier has eight safe alternatives across roads, side paths and wrecks. Only unstocked
    required quantities spawn, randomized and spaced apart; previous order positions
    are discouraged. At most one target may use a
    manipulator cache, only after purchasing the arm and within the accepted order's
    battery budget. Six story distance tiers and existing scene position overrides
    are preserved.
